        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We expect to continue to develop and build our intellectual property portfolio to address unmet technology and market needs going forward.",
        "start_character": 25964,
        "end_character": 26102
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001392380-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001392380-26-000006-c669b9fa443fbe13",
        "accession_number": "0001392380-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We produce and sell competitively priced, renewable, drop-in products for these sectors, and generate carbon abatement value through our plant design and business systems.",
        "start_character": 520,
        "end_character": 691
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001392380-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001392380-26-000006-c669b9fa443fbe13",
        "accession_number": "0001392380-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Because we began with the designs and know-how from the ATJ-60 project, we are able to shorten the time and costs to complete the development phase of the project.",
        "start_character": 6813,
        "end_character": 6976
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001392380-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001392380-26-000006-c669b9fa443fbe13",
        "accession_number": "0001392380-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In April 2023, we entered into a joint development agreement with LG Chem, Ltd.",
        "start_character": 15457,
        "end_character": 15536
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001392380-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001392380-26-000006-c669b9fa443fbe13",
        "accession_number": "0001392380-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition, we have partnered with other leading global technology companies to develop this system focused on three standard sizes, 30, 60 and 150 million gallons per year (“MMGPY”) of SAF, referred to as ATJ-30, ATJ-60 and ATJ-150, respectively.",
        "start_character": 3557,
        "end_character": 3805
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001392380-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001392380-26-000006-c669b9fa443fbe13",
        "accession_number": "0001392380-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Under the terms of the agreement with LG Chem, we will provide the core enabling technology we have developed for renewable olefins to be produced from low-carbon ethanol and will collaborate with LG Chem to accelerate the pilot research, technical scale-up, and commercialization of bio-propylene.",
        "start_character": 16238,
        "end_character": 16536
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001392380-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001392380-26-000006-c669b9fa443fbe13",
        "accession_number": "0001392380-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are evaluating and performing early site development work at several sites in the U.S.",
        "start_character": 10607,
        "end_character": 10696
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001392380-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001392380-26-000006-c669b9fa443fbe13",
        "accession_number": "0001392380-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We expect to continue engineering and development through 2026 before completing the front-end engineering design (“FEED”) phase of the project.",
        "start_character": 6581,
        "end_character": 6725
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001392380-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001392380-26-000006-c669b9fa443fbe13",
        "accession_number": "0001392380-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We have duplicated and modified the ATJ-60 design into an ATJ-30 design which is being designed to produce approximately 30 MMGPY of total hydrocarbon volumes, the majority of which would be SAF.",
        "start_character": 6220,
        "end_character": 6415
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001392380-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001392380-26-000006-c669b9fa443fbe13",
        "accession_number": "0001392380-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We have partnered with companies such as Zero6 Energy, formerly Juhl Energy, to develop the technology suite for this decarbonization.",
        "start_character": 22235,
        "end_character": 22369
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001392380-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001392380-26-000006-c669b9fa443fbe13",
        "accession_number": "0001392380-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "In addition, we are pursuing potential ATJ projects with several existing ethanol plant sites.",
        "start_character": 10881,
        "end_character": 10975
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001392380-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001392380-26-000006-c669b9fa443fbe13",
        "accession_number": "0001392380-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "We are in discussion with the DOE EDF around a further extension of the Conditional Commitment beyond April 16, 2026, which we believe is necessary to allow sufficient time for the negotiation and execution of the definitive financing agreement and to achieve financial close.",
